{"id":"w122648","name":"Latino Scramble","author":"Wikibooks Cookbook contributors","source":{"name":"Wikibooks Cookbook","url":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Cookbook:Latino_Scramble"},"via":{"name":"Wikibooks","url":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Cookbook:Latino_Scramble"},"image":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Latino_Scramble.jpg?width=640","cuisine":"Colombian","country":"","region":"Americas","course":"breakfast","protein":"pork","diet":0,"allergens":1982982,"minutes":10,"time":{"prep":10,"cook":0,"passive":0,"passiveWhy":[]},"timeEstimated":false,"servings":"6","difficulty":"easy","ingredients":[{"item":"6 eggs","qty":""},{"item":"1 large onion, finely chopped","qty":""},{"item":"1 large tomato, diced","qty":""},{"item":"6 ham slices, chopped","qty":""},{"item":"100 g grated mozzarella cheese","qty":""},{"item":"1 tbsp butter","qty":""},{"item":"Salt","qty":""},{"item":"Pepper","qty":""},{"item":"Tabasco sauce","qty":""},{"item":"1 tbsp ketchup","qty":""},{"item":"15 oz (425 g) sweet corn","qty":""}],"steps":["Melt butter in a medium frying pan over medium heat.","Add the chopped onions, and fry until they start to brown.","Add ham and sweet corn, and let fry for 5 minutes.","Add tomato, salt, and pepper. Though not traditional, you can also add one drop of Tabasco per egg.","Beat the eggs with ketchup, and add to frying pan. Immediately add mozzarella cheese.","Let cook to your desired egg texture."],"tags":[],"youtube":"","culture":null,"license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","lifestyle":0,"era":"modern"}